{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1499367-v5-canon-vs-w5-canon","id":1499367,"title":"V5 canon vs w5 canon?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-12-11T07:25:54-08:00","id":1499367,"title":"V5 canon vs w5 canon?","content":"I notice that v5, specifically the onyx path books, references w20 material. Should we just assume that w5 will have nothing to do with this canon either? Or is the reboot going to be a little more soft than Achille let on? Let the Streets Run Red mentions the Uktena specifically iirc, and CbN has Francesco in Rosa\u2019s bio. Hell Tally exists. <br /> <br /> I guess I\u2019m having a hard time reconciling what he\u2019s said in interviews with what\u2019s been previously established.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-11T07:48:29-08:00","id":1499372,"title":"","content":"I doubt that we'll have a clear picture until slated-to-be-printed material from the book is actually being previewed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-11T08:09:18-08:00","id":1499376,"title":"","content":"I think simply due to the timing of when what was developed, it's safe to assume that previous V5-material wasn't written with the changes W5 is going for in mind. Like, the native American Tribes have been renamed and now have no ethnic ties. Therefore any reference to them or those ethnic ties wouldn't fit with what W5 will be doing, for example.<br /> <br /> But even when it comes to V5-canon, I'm curious how the upcoming V5 players guide will turn out. After all, Justin Achilli believes that V5 has been unfocused. Maybe there will be a bit of a reappraisal for what V5's premise is exactly, as well.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-11T10:14:22-08:00","id":1499389,"title":"","content":"That\u2019s a fair point I hadn\u2019t considered. So what he\u2019s gonna bring it back to just the blood hunter?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-11T10:51:37-08:00","id":1499392,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lyrics Of War</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1499367-v5-canon-vs-w5-canon?p=1499389#post1499389\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That\u2019s a fair point I hadn\u2019t considered. So what he\u2019s gonna bring it back to just the blood hunter?</div> </div> </div> </div>Of course, we will only really know what's up after these things have been released but... what was talked about was the V5 players guide, for example, giving more options for banes for each Clan, so that it would be more up to the players to choose what their Clan is about. Given how H5 and W5 have been handled, it stands to reason that Justin Achilli would wanna exclude a lot of old WOD-material from V5 as well.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-11T11:05:48-08:00","id":1499393,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1499367-v5-canon-vs-w5-canon?p=1499392#post1499392\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Of course, we will only really know what's up after these things have been released but... what was talked about was the V5 players guide, for example, giving more options for banes for each Clan, so that it would be more up to the players to choose what their Clan is about. Given how H5 and W5 have been handled, it stands to reason that Justin Achilli would wanna exclude a lot of old WOD-material from V5 as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>So a soft soft reboot/ v5.5. I\u2019m curious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-11T11:57:02-08:00","id":1499394,"title":"","content":"It's very likely going forward that future V5 books will be treating it as entirely seperate from &quot; Legacy&quot; lore, like H5 and W5.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-11T14:34:36-08:00","id":1499402,"title":"","content":"Yeah, it's unlikely that V5 will get an explicit hard reboot, but it's unlikely that it's material will refer to earlier lore from other lines' earlier editions anymore. Although it's also important to note that OPP worked on most of the 20th Anniversary books (I want to say they did everything past V20 core, but I'm not certain), so their stable of writers is probably more familiar with it than most of the WW staff.<br /> <br /> As to the V5 player's guide, well JA seems to be doing what he wanted to do with nWoD. So we'll probably see optional banes and systems to focus the game on Neonate-level starving Anarchs looking to kill and/or eat their sites. As well as attempts to remove the reasons players might still want to side with the Camarilla (V5 made them terminally stupid, but they also turned the Anarchs into the Sabbat), because god forbid people try to interpret the game in a way Justin doesn't <br /> <br /> Now I'm not that against the broad strokes of V5 lore, and I'm also not entirely opposed to some of the W5 changes that have come out (Tribe renames are mostly meh, making it so Act 1 of the apocalypse is fine, but the changes to kinfolk massively shift Garou society).<br /> <br /> Or maybe it'll end up more like Monte Cook's World of Darkness, where the main line (Vampire) continues on and you have this weird niche side game hanging on with it's own lore. Which will be a terrible thing for Werewolf, but I'm finding myself less and less willing to care for W5 with each new revelation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}